    24	//! Shared-library face of the translation (`crate-type = ["cdylib"]`).
    25	//!
    26	//! Exports the same symbols `mdcore.c` contributes to a link: `op_add`,
    27	//! `op_sub`, `op_mul`, `G_OP`, `G_OP_NAME`, `helper_call`, `helper_ptr`, and
    28	//! `use_generated`.
    29	//!
    30	//! Which operation and how many unrolled steps those symbols use is fixed at
    31	//! build time by Cargo features, mirroring the CMake cache variables:
    32	//!
    33	//! ```text
    34	//! cmake -DOP=mul -DREPEAT=3   ~   cargo build --no-default-features --features mul,3
    35	//! ```
