[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    `default: break;` arm of `DISPATCH_REP` (`mdmacros.h:91`), reached through the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    public `use_generated`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 3. `atoi`'s own no-digits / out-of-range behaviour, which `main` feeds into every
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    subsequent computation.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Because `op_*`, `helper_call`, `helper_ptr` take plain `int` by value and never
